+# shop-api
+
+## Configuration
+
+Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and fill in real values:
+
+```sh
+AUTH_SECRET=<a long random string>
+ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
+```
+
+To call the API locally, sign a token and send it as a bearer header:
+
+```ts
+const config = { user: "admin", password: "<your-password>" };
+```
+
+Never commit real keys; CI rejects them.
